msgstr "소스 구조"

#: ../../architecture.rst:7 22c32c6da6984acd8e8dc0e6178da1cf
msgid "All of the plugin's logic lives under ``src/``:"
msgstr "플러그인의 모든 로직은 ``src/`` 아래에 있습니다:"

#: ../../architecture.rst:13 0a197373ea7f46c5b3236f9455d01d58
msgid "File"
msgstr "파일"

#: ../../architecture.rst:14 10d7c14bccad48a8b01628dfc39283be
